v4.6 P2: pass a random challenge at the verify() call sites that are actually
executed (Decrypt_User_Synth_Pass(), "using secdis to decrypt spblob" branch):

  HIDL (used on mars, the vendor has no AIDL gatekeeper):
      gk_device->verify(fakeUid(user_id), gk_challenge, pwd_handle_hidl, ...)
  AIDL (patched for symmetry):
      aidl_gk_device->verify(fakeUid(user_id), gk_challenge_aidl, ...)

The v4.5 patch had been applied to Decrypt_User()'s legacy branch, which this
device never reaches (recovery.log shows "Using synthetic password method" ->
"using secdis to decrypt spblob"), so it had no effect.  Note that the decisive
fix for the -45 is P1 (the missing SPU firmware path), not the challenge value.
